# Examples Showcase

Three documents, each rendering successfully under the default policy
profile with no extra grants: nothing here needs shell, HTTP, or `@code`.

- [`report.stage`](./report.stage) - a project report: directory contents
  and counts, computed on every render.
- [`api-reference.stage`](./api-reference.stage) - a reference table
  generated from `cli-reference.json`, not hand-maintained.

Render any of them directly:

```
livestage render examples/showcase/report.stage
livestage render examples/showcase/api-reference.stage
```
